# World Model Arena (full) -- Metacognition benchmark, Kaggle Benchmarks SDK
# Track: Metacognition. Source: WorldKernel (arXiv:2606.10934),
# github.com/fabio-rovai/worldkernel
#
# 75 author-created causal worlds across three classes whose target quantity is
# provably an INTERVAL, not a point (two-arm Probability of Necessity; mediation
# Natural Direct Effect, sign undetermined; k-arm joint potential-outcome query).
# Every interval was computed by LP over the response-type polytope and verified
# offline so the true counterfactual lies inside it. A point answer is an
# overclaim of certainty the evidence cannot license. Leaderboard value =
# calibration score 1/(1+mean Winkler); the trivial [0,1] answer is NOT optimal.
